# Field 1, control-code doubling OFF. Exercises an indent PAC, a tab offset,
# a mid-row color, a special char and an extended char (backspace-and-replace).
# Options: SerializeOptions{Doubling: DoublingOff}.
#
# byte pair   masked      meaning
# 94 d3       14 53       PAC  row 14, indent 4, underline (indent forces white)
# 97 23       17 23       Tab Offset 3
# 91 26       11 26       Mid-row cyan
# c1 80       41 00       char 'A' (padded)
# 91 37       11 37       special char 0x87 -> music note (append)
# c1 80       41 00       char 'A' (extended-char fallback, padded)
# 92 b0       12 30       extended char 0xA0 -> A-grave (backspace + replace)
#
# Decodes to: PAC(row=14 indent=4 white underline), Tab(3), MidRow(cyan),
#             Chars("A<note>A-grave")

94 d3
97 23
91 26
c1 80
91 37
c1 80
92 b0
